      <h2 id="hcp-backup-etcd-snapshot-restore_hcp-backup-etcd-snapshot" class="group scroll-mt-20">Restoring etcd data by using the etcd snapshot method<a href="#hcp-backup-etcd-snapshot-restore_hcp-backup-etcd-snapshot" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
